A thread destroyed takes the threads that lend it their time off its ring but leaves them waiting.
The walk takes no waiter away, so its steps are paid for by nothing, and the lenders are not told.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call was preempted before it took anything away

